{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的 S05 只有18秒，却同时呈现两大组没有分时出现的感受词，实际扫读压力明显大于X。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的话语更短，重点有加亮提示，普通观众更容易迅速抓住每段发生了什么；感受词又能跟着音乐节点出现，不只是罗列情绪，而是让人感到情绪怎样一步步变化。尤其水面、小船、摇荡等意象反复出现，直到结尾小船定住、开头的话得到回应，前后有明显的整体联系。X 的优势是人物心理动机解释得更完整，但Y在音乐同步、视觉重点和感受细腻度上整体更胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0225089d-437d-4f3c-95c1-a16465f8350c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T155703604123Z", "elapsed_seconds": 62.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T15:58:05.912065+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "10066cd37bbe326aa925099e5d2fd15c8ae48f2f42a33be3d3f057723b13674d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee